SUMMARY:Clackamas ESD Regional Art Show
DESCRIPTION:Join us in celebrating the extraordinary artistic talent of students in our region! Each year\, Clackamas ESD presents diverse artwork from middle and high school students representing all 10 Clackamas County school districts in a juried art show and awards thousands of dollars in prizes at the art show awards ceremony. \nEditor’s note: This event is a community submission.
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/clackamas-esd-regional-art-show-gallery/2026-04-24/
LOCATION:Clackamas ESD administrative building\, 13455 SE 97th Avenue\, Clackamas
CATEGORIES:Arts/Crafts,Indoor,Kids Calendar
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://pdxparent.com/wp-content/uploads/Art-gallery.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Clackamas Education Service District":MAILTO:kwyatt@clackesd.k12.or.us
END:VEVENT
