SUMMARY:North Portland Book Crawl
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Independent Bookstore Day all weekend with year two of the North Portland Book Crawl! With three new stops\, new maps\, and double the prize package supporting your local bookstores has never been so fun!\n\n\nEvent details:\n\nPick up your punch card at any participating shop!\n\nGet your card punched or stamped at each shop any time on Independent Bookstore Day (Saturday 4/25) or Sunday 4/26. You just need to visit\, no purchase required. \n\n\nDrop off your card at Second Shapes Bookstore (8124 N. Denver Ave) or send a picture to @secondshapesbookstore on social media or hello@secondshapesbookstore.com. \n\n\nEveryone who participates gets a free used book from Second Shapes! One lucky winner will get an amazing prize package with gifts from all participating shops. \n\n\nParticipating Shops: \n\n\nReggie’s Manga Shop\, 7015 N Greeley \n\n\nSecond Shapes Bookstore\, 8124 N Denver \n\n\nArches Book House\, 8900 N Wall \n\n\nAlways Here Book Store\, 4555 N Williams \n\n\nRevolutions Bookshop\, 8713 N Lombard \n\n\nTwo Rivers Bookstore\, 8836 N Lombard \n\n\nGreen Bean Books\, 1600 NE Alberta \n\n\nMidslumber Media\, 1609 NE Alberta \n\n\nMelville Books\, 2827 NE Alberta \n\n\nParallel Worlds\, 2639 NE Alberta \n\n\nMonograph Bookwerks\, 5005 NE 27th Ave* \n\n\nRose City Book Pub\, 1329 NE Fremont* \n\n\nA Children’s Place\, 1423 NE Fremont*
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/north-portland-book-crawl/2026-04-25/
LOCATION:OR
CATEGORIES:Educational,Family Fun,Kids Calendar
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://pdxparent.com/wp-content/uploads/North-Portland-Book-Crawl.jpg
END:VEVENT
