SUMMARY:Oregon Ag Fest
DESCRIPTION:Oregon Ag Fest is a family fun event with over 25 free hands-on activities for kids! Ride ponies\, watch chicks hatch\, dig for potatoes and so much more! Have fun learning where your food\, fiber and flora come from! Kids 15 & under free admission. Parking is also free!.
