SUMMARY:Great Exchange Swap Event St. Johns
DESCRIPTION:This free neighborhood swapping event\, and help promote sustainability within our community. \nStart your spring cleaning now\, and plan ahead to drop off your items within our donation hours! Then\, stroll the tables of available new-to-you goodies for FREE! If you do not have items to donate\, you can bring non-perishable food or diaper donations on the day of the event for entry. \nThink GREEN this spring! Share with your community!
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/great-exchange-2026/
LOCATION:7535 N. Chicago Ave.\, 7535 N. Chicago Ave.\, Portland
CATEGORIES:Earth Day,Kids Calendar
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://pdxparent.com/wp-content/uploads/great-exchange-.jpg
